  (text
    "Function: Translates the PCIe SMBus clock/data lines between the host auxiliary 3.3 V domain and module VIO1.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310 A01 schematic, sheet 2, U2 SMBus circuit. https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 . Original\nrefs/values/connections retained; R16/R17 DNP. Internal net NetC10_2 is named PCIE_SMBUS_VREF2. Drawing adapted to native KiCad; electrical operation unverified."
    (at 33.48 1264.11 0)
