  (text
    "Function: Translates the active-low host PCIe reset into the selected 1.2 V FPGA reset domain.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310 A01 schematic, sheet 2, U4 PERST circuit. https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 . Original refs/values/pins\nretained; R12/R20/R21/R22 DNP. NetC11_2 is named PCIE_PERST_VCCA. R1/R2/R7/R8 selection is shown beside this figure; reset/enumeration timing unverified."
