    "Function: Translates active-low FPGA WAKE to the PCIe host auxiliary-power domain.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310 A01 schematic, sheet 2, U6 WAKE circuit. https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 . Original refs/values/pins\nretained; R26 DNP. NetC28_2 is named PCIE_WAKE_VREF2. Unused U6 channel is explicitly unconnected; operation unverified."
