  (text
    "Function: Enables the PCIe auxiliary-powered translator circuitry only when the module VIO power-good condition is present.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310 A01 schematic, sheet 2, U5 auxiliary load switch. https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 . Original\nrefs/values/pins retained. NetR18_1 / NetR24_2 are named PCIE_AUX_FAULT_N / PCIE_AUX_ILIM. Transfer of inherited circuit only; startup/fault behavior unverified."
