  (text
    "Function: Generates the VIO-present condition used to isolate PCIe level translators during module power loss.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310 A01 schematic, sheet 2, Q1 VIO power-good circuit. https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 . Both original Q1\nunits and R30-R33 refs/values/pins retained. NetQ1_5 is named PCIE_VIO_INVERTED. Transfer of inherited circuit only; thresholds and transitions unverified."
    (at 472.9 1264.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "0bc5211f-069c-541b-85fb-1ebf6c373a80"))
