  (text
    "Function: Selects fixed-1.2-V PERST and connects the remaining PCIe sidebands to their original module pins.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310 A01 schematic, sheet 1, R1/R2/R7-R11 selectors. https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 . References and 0-ohm\nvalues retained. Default R2/R7 fitted, R1/R8 DNP. R9/R10/R11 fitted. No silent remapping to accommodate recording inputs."
    (at 472.9 1415.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "1495a57c-ea28-569e-8c1a-2255e5c054f3"))
