  (text
    "Function: Mate to the XEM8310; Bank64 L1-L8 drive eight ordinary LVDS stimulation-command pairs.\nThe module supplies VIO1 and1.8V; the unused old HP recording inputs are explicitly NC.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01 sheet1 and official Pins:\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310 . Codex V7 replaces six HP receivers with\neight GPIO outputs and retains Bank64 L17/L20 PCIe sidebands. VIO1=1.8V is mandatory.\nSet XEM8310_VIO1_VOLTAGE=180 using native FrontPanel USB, fully power-cycle and verify.\nFactorydefault100=1.0V; JTAG and IOSTANDARD do not change this rail. Device Settings:\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8310/device-settings/ . VIO1 total700mA; addedVIOcap max10uF.\nAMD UG571 v1.16 p121: LVDS output requires1.8V; no external transmitter termination.\nhttps://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug571-ultrascale-selectio . Command timing/protocol unqualified."
    (at 34.32 966.47 0.0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "3dc03cf1-9355-5871-9abc-b0d0e9487827"))
