  (text
    "Function: Selects the module internal SYSMON reference.\n\nSource / changes: BRK8310-A01 sheet1: R6=0R fitted by Default variant; external\nU1/C1-C3/R5 DNP option omitted. Connections VREFP to GNDADC unchanged.\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8310/expansion-connectors/"
    (at 466.09 960.12 0.0)
