  (text
    "Function: Mates the custom carrier to the purchased XEM8310. All80 contact numbers are retained; matching globals carry assigned signals. NC marks denote deliberately unused contacts in this revision.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01 sheet1 and official XEM8310 Pins (25 Oct 2026): https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310 . Codex redraw and six-HP/one-GT allocation; general breakout headers and their unused HD/HP/GT connections are\nomitted. External unused GT reference inputs are NC; on-module GT reference selection remains a gateware task. No8305 pin map reused. V8 rough PCB placement completed; new routing/refill pending.\nV6: MC2.70 is the module 3.3V output, modeled power_out. No HDMI power is\ndrawn from it. XEM onboard rail total2A includes internal loads: see\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8310/powering-the-xem8310/ ."
    (at 464.85 984.57 0.0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6dd09717-7d0b-5665-bbaf-64d677ba834d"))
