  (text
    "Function: Mate all12 GTY channels, PCIe reference clock and fixed1.2V sideband supply to XEM8310.\nGTY224/226 RX0-3 serve eight recording ports; GTY225 RX/TX0-3 serve PCIe physical lanes3-0.\n\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01 sheet1; https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310 .\nCodex V7 repurposes224 from upper PCIe lanes and226 from Bull’s Eye. Unused TX224/226 are NC.\nExternal REFCLK0 inputs224/226 remain NC; internal125MHz at225REFCLK0 is forwarded in the FPGA.\nHost100MHz remains225REFCLK1, MC3.17/19. See adjacent clock plan. No module oscillator is added.\nBank67 stays1.2V; PERST R1 DNP/R2 fitted and MC3.78 preserved. MC3.80 remains a module supply output.\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8310/expansion-connectors/ . Vivado x4/clock coexistence remains unverified."
    (at 895.38 966.47 0.0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f5d96997-9942-5f20-843b-611e430346b1"))
