  (text
    "Function: Supply XEM8310 +VDCIN from one selected input.\nJ4 and J5 are alternatives: connect only one source."
    (at 1454.29 906.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "682261f7-1bab-5a0c-aa34-7f0d7907120e"))
  (text
    "Source / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01, sheet 1, J4/J5/C5/C6.\nOriginal refs, values and pin/net connections retained; redrawn.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3\nV6 adds source/return ERC flags at the actual external entry.\nOnly ONE input source: no J4/J5 ORing circuit is present.\n12 V nominal supply capacity must include XEM + HDMI loads.\nInput cable/PCB current and fault qualification remain open."
    (at 1454.29 915.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "de2b9b79-6347-59ab-83c9-d020ee7f9e34"))
