  (text
    "Source / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01, sheet 1, J3/C4.\nOriginal refs, values, JTAG pin numbers and net connections retained.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3\nRedrawn symbol geometry. Level translation and hardware target selection are implemented in the V5 blocks below.\nV5 splits the four J3 signals into EXT_JTAG nets; U700 below selects external J3 or onboard USB. Original J3/C4 values and pin numbers are retained."
    (at 1624.29 899.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "815eb5f7-087e-546a-a042-dae9a95bad96"))
