  (text
    "Function: Indicate module +3.3 V and main-input presence\nusing two inherited resistor / LED branches."
    (at 1579.29 970.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "8bb1f76c-3bf3-5904-9756-505ff17a953a"))
  (text
    "Source / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01, sheet 1, R3/D1 and R4/D2.\nR3=549 Ω, R4=2.00 kΩ; original pin connections retained.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3\nVisible values simplified; green LED PN unchanged.\nR4 input-voltage / thermal derating remains open."
    (at 1579.29 979.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "65160a8f-9ece-5edc-9dd4-c7e045f05507"))
  (text
    "HDMI POWER / TWO BANKS IMPLEMENTED BELOW"
    (at 1711.29 958.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "102e3b9f-bf74-5ea3-8ddf-8d86a4fcd9e8"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 1711.29 967.21) (xy 1969.77 967.21) (xy 1969.77 1043.21) (xy 1711.29 1043.21) (xy 1711.29 967.21))
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "9637bac6-16fb-5c20-a3db-d00ed5815461"))
  (text
    "Function: Supply all eight HDMI pin19 contacts through two independent protected3.3V power banks.\nPlanning load8x0.55A+0.05A=4.45A; ASIC/LDO assemblies are separately powered."
    (at 1714.29 970.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6d85049c-64ee-5ed9-983e-1bab457f1b0c"))
  (text
    "Source / changes: Codex V7 adapts the V6 TPS56637 and TPS259470L circuits below.\nTwo6A-rated converters each feed four eFuses; outputs are never paralleled or tied to XEM+3.3V.\n0.55A/board is a planning allocation; cable, current, transient and thermal tests remain pending."
    (at 1714.29 983.01 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "fe0d7435-54ab-550f-bb1c-3a341ef36d20"))
