  (text
    "Function: D500 protects both USB2 data lines and VBUS at J500.\nUSB_DP/DM_CONN are the socket side; USB_D_P/N go to U501.\n\nSource / changes: Codex adds ST USBLC6-2SC6 using ST DS4260\nRev7,Dec2021,p1top-view pin diagram andpp3-6 ESD/layout guidance.\nhttps://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/usblc6-2.pdf\nPins1/6=I/O1,3/4=I/O2,2=GND,5=VBUS. Flow-through topology;\nplace at the connector with a short direct ground return. Not in\nthe inherited BRK frontend; USB ESD/EMI still needs board testing."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 2399.76 258.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "148c2cea-7191-422f-b873-bfca344abddc"))
