  (text
    "Function: U506 supplies JTAG_LOGIC_3V3 from USB5V for the selector\nand branch logic. It stays separate from the FTDI3V3 internal rail.\n\nSource / changes: Codex adapts TI TLV755P typical application,\nSBVS320D,RevD,Sep2024,p1,p3Table4-1,sec6.3.2 andsec7.2.\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tlv755p.pdf\nTLV75533PDBVR,DBV:SOT-23-5;1IN,2GND,3EN,4NC,5OUT.\nEN tied to IN; C520/C521=2.2uF ceramic,chosen by Codex to allow\nDC-bias margin above TI1uF effective minimum. USB current,\neffective capacitance, reverse current and dissipation need review."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 2399.76 313.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "10f65eea-b6b7-470a-bfa6-46fa9be5a326"))
