  (text
    "Function: Selects one JTAG master for XEM8310. SEL=0 selects the onboard USB branch; SEL=1 selects external header J3. /EN is grounded. External and USB masters are never wired directly together.\n\nSource / changes: Codex arbitration design using TI TMUX1574 SCDS391C (December 2019), pp.3-5; Table1/sec8.5; secs9.2-11; https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tmux1574.pdf . TSSOP pin map and 100nF bypass follow TI; new J3 branch split changes four short header-end tracks only.\nVDD uses XEM 1.8V, with powered-off signal isolation. This is a new circuit, not an unchanged BRK circuit."
    (at 2200.1 493.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6e1766ce-55fa-5bd9-94d9-35a0203abe2a"))
