  (rectangle
    (start 265.43 106.68)
    (end 427.99 130.7)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "66c558da-6f73-5da3-aacf-a4c14415b9d6"))
  (text
    "Function: Receive all recording data on one GTY224 channel0, MC3 1/3. Send stimulation commands through Bank64 ordinary LVDS outputs MC1 10/12; no\nGT transmitter used.\n\nSource / changes: Codex V7 adaptation of BRK8310 and existing custom Type-D contact map. C1101/C1102=100nF series AC coupling added because\nstandalone V65 J3.3/5 directly reach Artix TX0 H2/H1. AMD UG578 v1.4 p340: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug578-ultrascale-gty-transceivers . No HP\nreceive bias/termination remains. Command12/14 is DC coupled; use remote ordinary LVDS receiver plus100ohm termination, not GTP RX A4/A3. UG571\nv1.16 p121: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug571-ultrascale-selectio . Spare pairs6/8 and9/11 NC. Target3.125Gb/s is a planning rate;\nVivado/cable/BER checks pending."
    (at 268.43 109.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "68d3ac24-2433-5b87-9ad0-ed89c7b8dc68"))
  (rectangle
    (start 198.32 330.2)
    (end 428.32 345.71)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "6d94d15c-0c46-5817-95e4-c14bcc72d76b"))
  (text
    "Function: Power pin19 feeds only this port; pin1 senses remote1.8V; four JTAG signals use the selected target branch.\n\nSource / changes: Inherited custom cable contract, not standard HDMI. Molex467651001 contacts: https://www.molex.com/en-us/products/part-detail/467651001 . V7 adds P8 and retains grounds4/7/10/13/16 and shell.\nPower, reset/fault and JTAG branches are drawn below. Remote GPIO command remap is required."
    (at 201.32 333.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d6530f7b-fd94-5bae-9056-f97b6aff643a"))
  (rectangle
    (start 450.85 60.96)
    (end 869.95 396.24)
    (stroke (width 0.508) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "b08b8c53-4313-54ab-8daa-72fedd582f13"))
