  (rectangle
    (start 695.96 106.68)
    (end 858.52 130.7)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "37d619d4-1bc8-5018-8264-31040ea1c8c4"))
  (text
    "Function: Receive all recording data on one GTY224 channel1, MC3 5/7. Send stimulation commands through Bank64 ordinary LVDS outputs MC1 14/16; no\nGT transmitter used.\n\nSource / changes: Codex V7 adaptation of BRK8310 and existing custom Type-D contact map. C1201/C1202=100nF series AC coupling added because\nstandalone V65 J3.3/5 directly reach Artix TX0 H2/H1. AMD UG578 v1.4 p340: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug578-ultrascale-gty-transceivers . No HP\nreceive bias/termination remains. Command12/14 is DC coupled; use remote ordinary LVDS receiver plus100ohm termination, not GTP RX A4/A3. UG571\nv1.16 p121: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug571-ultrascale-selectio . Spare pairs6/8 and9/11 NC. Target3.125Gb/s is a planning rate;\nVivado/cable/BER checks pending."
    (at 698.96 109.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e2719e30-6029-54ae-81eb-02074a9bfd7f"))
  (rectangle
    (start 628.85 330.2)
    (end 858.85 345.71)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "c8d4e029-1e5b-5489-8f08-d2850fd45e21"))
  (text
    "Function: Power pin19 feeds only this port; pin1 senses remote1.8V; four JTAG signals use the selected target branch.\n\nSource / changes: Inherited custom cable contract, not standard HDMI. Molex467651001 contacts: https://www.molex.com/en-us/products/part-detail/467651001 . V7 adds P8 and retains grounds4/7/10/13/16 and shell.\nPower, reset/fault and JTAG branches are drawn below. Remote GPIO command remap is required."
    (at 631.85 333.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bdde5eaf-a6c1-5f78-a801-ea8995d5a189"))
  (rectangle
    (start 881.38 60.96)
    (end 1300.48 396.24)
    (stroke (width 0.508) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "25399eb1-a164-501e-8df0-3e2c411d37ad"))
