  (rectangle
    (start 1126.49 106.68)
    (end 1289.05 130.7)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "2caec627-3ff4-527a-bb29-a6d342fecf9e"))
  (text
    "Function: Receive all recording data on one GTY224 channel2, MC3 9/11. Send stimulation commands through Bank64 ordinary LVDS outputs MC1 13/15; no\nGT transmitter used.\n\nSource / changes: Codex V7 adaptation of BRK8310 and existing custom Type-D contact map. C1301/C1302=100nF series AC coupling added because\nstandalone V65 J3.3/5 directly reach Artix TX0 H2/H1. AMD UG578 v1.4 p340: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug578-ultrascale-gty-transceivers . No HP\nreceive bias/termination remains. Command12/14 is DC coupled; use remote ordinary LVDS receiver plus100ohm termination, not GTP RX A4/A3. UG571\nv1.16 p121: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug571-ultrascale-selectio . Spare pairs6/8 and9/11 NC. Target3.125Gb/s is a planning rate;\nVivado/cable/BER checks pending."
    (at 1129.49 109.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "8f8fdcc1-01ca-59cf-8db4-192f743c0c8f"))
  (rectangle
    (start 1059.38 330.2)
    (end 1289.38 345.71)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "7e0517e9-d49f-5597-baaf-ff4c75b09ee2"))
  (text
    "Function: Power pin19 feeds only this port; pin1 senses remote1.8V; four JTAG signals use the selected target branch.\n\nSource / changes: Inherited custom cable contract, not standard HDMI. Molex467651001 contacts: https://www.molex.com/en-us/products/part-detail/467651001 . V7 adds P8 and retains grounds4/7/10/13/16 and shell.\nPower, reset/fault and JTAG branches are drawn below. Remote GPIO command remap is required."
    (at 1062.38 333.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bc3d65ad-b2d9-58b6-a1f6-33d373c94884"))
  (rectangle
