  (text
    "Function: Receive all recording data on one GTY226 channel0, MC3 41/43. Send stimulation commands through Bank64 ordinary LVDS outputs MC1 5/7; no\nGT transmitter used.\n\nSource / changes: Codex V7 adaptation of BRK8310 and existing custom Type-D contact map. C1501/C1502=100nF series AC coupling added because\nstandalone V65 J3.3/5 directly reach Artix TX0 H2/H1. AMD UG578 v1.4 p340: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug578-ultrascale-gty-transceivers . No HP\nreceive bias/termination remains. Command12/14 is DC coupled; use remote ordinary LVDS receiver plus100ohm termination, not GTP RX A4/A3. UG571\nv1.16 p121: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug571-ultrascale-selectio . Spare pairs6/8 and9/11 NC. Target3.125Gb/s is a planning rate;\nVivado/cable/BER checks pending."
    (at 268.43 460.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "9c423275-f997-5e39-81b3-61ff921a68d0"))
  (rectangle
    (start 198.32 680.72)
    (end 428.32 696.23)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "ce5eb0ea-ebfe-5c40-b085-6d7e2a57773c"))
  (text
    "Function: Power pin19 feeds only this port; pin1 senses remote1.8V; four JTAG signals use the selected target branch.\n\nSource / changes: Inherited custom cable contract, not standard HDMI. Molex467651001 contacts: https://www.molex.com/en-us/products/part-detail/467651001 . V7 adds P8 and retains grounds4/7/10/13/16 and shell.\nPower, reset/fault and JTAG branches are drawn below. Remote GPIO command remap is required."
    (at 201.32 683.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "750f0259-9eab-5107-ac82-509cbc0c292d"))
