    (uuid "4e41d333-91c0-5752-9057-9fe2c3897c92"))
  (text
    "Function: Receive all recording data on one GTY226 channel1, MC3 45/47. Send stimulation commands through Bank64 ordinary LVDS outputs MC1 9/11; no\nGT transmitter used.\n\nSource / changes: Codex V7 adaptation of BRK8310 and existing custom Type-D contact map. C1601/C1602=100nF series AC coupling added because\nstandalone V65 J3.3/5 directly reach Artix TX0 H2/H1. AMD UG578 v1.4 p340: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug578-ultrascale-gty-transceivers . No HP\nreceive bias/termination remains. Command12/14 is DC coupled; use remote ordinary LVDS receiver plus100ohm termination, not GTP RX A4/A3. UG571\nv1.16 p121: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug571-ultrascale-selectio . Spare pairs6/8 and9/11 NC. Target3.125Gb/s is a planning rate;\nVivado/cable/BER checks pending."
    (at 698.96 460.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "4cdde91a-638d-5e83-aa0e-42b88516bdad"))
  (rectangle
    (start 628.85 680.72)
    (end 858.85 696.23)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "a295ca75-4751-5595-abf0-359c716b5927"))
  (text
    "Function: Power pin19 feeds only this port; pin1 senses remote1.8V; four JTAG signals use the selected target branch.\n\nSource / changes: Inherited custom cable contract, not standard HDMI. Molex467651001 contacts: https://www.molex.com/en-us/products/part-detail/467651001 . V7 adds P8 and retains grounds4/7/10/13/16 and shell.\nPower, reset/fault and JTAG branches are drawn below. Remote GPIO command remap is required."
    (at 631.85 683.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "38cb3122-fd30-5c52-8557-b0ccdbc182e7"))
  (rectangle
    (start 881.38 411.48)
    (end 1300.48 746.76)
    (stroke (width 0.508) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "f2685960-da76-5288-a4b3-372300783635"))
