  (text
    "Function: Select XEM8310 or one of eight Artix-7 cable targets.\nSwitch positions1-9=XEM/P1-P8;10-12=OFF.\nEXTERNAL master mode drives rotary common LOW; all nine branches disable."
    (at 2233.93 1054.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "5f2a9378-6ef2-563f-bc63-89e3b67fa99d"))
  (text
    "Source / changes: Codex V7 adaptation of V5 onehot selector; SW600 now12positions. Grayhill Series56 Rev2024/10 pp1-2,4:56P30-01-1-12N-F\nnonshorting PC-mount fixed-stop switch. https://www.grayhill.com/wp-content/uploads/media/56-datasheet.pdf\nAll12 outer terminals retained;10-12 NC(all-off). TPS3808 per-branch MR resets enable delay.\nHardware independent of FPGA configuration. Parent retains master DPDT/TMUX1574 recovery.\nExact MPN:grayhill.com/products/rotational-controls/rotary-switches/single-deck-rotary-switch/56/56p30-01-1-12n-f/"
    (at 2233.93 1064.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "5e94da34-ee59-51f6-9991-335d6b3a3c81"))
