  (text
    "Function: Pass only selected, powered target JTAG. MR LOW disables immediately;\nvalid target plus stable selection delays enable20ms typical(12-28ms).\n1G17 restores guaranteed OE LOW/HIGH; unselected TDO remains Hi-Z."
    (at 2664.46 1456.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e1e58fce-0182-5a7e-9bbf-8b1ee5d15a32"))
  (text
    "Source / changes: Inherited V5 Codex topology; V7 adds identical P8 branch. TI TXU0304 SCES935A RevA Nov2021 pp4,7-8,20-25;\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/txu0304.pdf ; TPS3808 SBVS050N RevN Aug2026 pp3-7,10-12;\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps3808.pdf ; SN74LVC1G17 SCES351Y RevY Oct2025 pp3,5-7;\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/sn74lvc1g17.pdf\nTPS=G18(1.67V nominal),CT open;10k MR PD,10k RESET PU,100k OE PD.\n33R outputs are provisional damping; start TCK1MHz. Sense1M PD; remote1k remains.\nRemote rail loss/unplug cutoff latency and final cable rate require powered validation."
    (at 2664.46 1468.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6d2c7def-2594-57e1-aa09-b343769ba574"))
  (text
    "POS4 — P3 ARTIX-7 / 1.8 V JTAG"
