    (uuid "10299345-1c7d-5697-8d9c-63b6192af327"))
  (text
    "Function: Produces the P1–P4 HDMI supply from external +VDCIN(7.5–15V contract,12V nominal), independently of XEM onboard\n+3.3V. Nominal output3.318V;6A IC capacity versus2.225A allocation (4x0.55A+0.025A); independent second source feeds P5–P8.\nPG gates port startup. This supply excludes separately powered ASIC/LDO boards.\n\nSource / changes: Codex adaptation of TI TPS56637 SLVSEG1A(Sept2019), Fig17/p18 and Table4/p19;\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps56637.pdf . R802/R803 changed to45.3k/10k0.1% (3.263–3.374V static tolerance\nscreen);L800=2.2uH(Coilcraft XAL7070-222MEC);C810–812=3x22uF16V X7R;no feedforward R/C fitted. Bootstrap0.1uF and\nR800169k/R80136.1k follow TI. MODE grounded(Eco). Cout must meet20–100uF EFFECTIVE including bias/temp;66uF nominal is not a\nguarantee. Input/loop/thermal and simultaneous-load validation remain open. Coilcraft rating19.6A Isat and13.2A Irms(20C\nrise) are25C vendor values:\nhttps://www.coilcraft.com/en-us/products/power/shielded-inductors/molded-inductor/xal/xal7070/xal7070-222/ ."
    (at 823.32 1614.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "8e2f734a-c491-514d-9089-58842228a848"))
