    (uuid "ae4b9002-d4c1-5358-99e9-fe11d6d78821"))
  (text
    "Function: Produces the P5–P8 HDMI supply from external +VDCIN(7.5–15V contract,12V nominal), independently of XEM onboard\n+3.3V. Nominal output3.318V;6A IC capacity versus2.225A allocation (4x0.55A+0.025A); independent first source feeds P1–P4.\nPG gates port startup. This supply excludes separately powered ASIC/LDO boards.\n\nSource / changes: Codex adaptation of TI TPS56637 SLVSEG1A(Sept2019), Fig17/p18 and Table4/p19;\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps56637.pdf . R902/R903 changed to45.3k/10k0.1% (3.263–3.374V static tolerance\nscreen);L900=2.2uH(Coilcraft XAL7070-222MEC);C910–C912=3x22uF16V X7R;no feedforward R/C fitted. Bootstrap0.1uF and\nR800169k/R80136.1k follow TI. MODE grounded(Eco). Cout must meet20–100uF EFFECTIVE including bias/temp;66uF nominal is not a\nguarantee. Input/loop/thermal and simultaneous-load validation remain open. Coilcraft rating19.6A Isat and13.2A Irms(20C\nrise) are25C vendor values:\nhttps://www.coilcraft.com/en-us/products/power/shielded-inductors/molded-inductor/xal/xal7070/xal7070-222/ ."
    (at 823.32 1839.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "31dadebe-4dc6-5a70-bb9d-9f8bc75cc4f3"))
  (text
    "P1 / 3.3V PROTECTED POWER / INDIVIDUAL RESET"
