  (text
    "Function: Feeds HDMI P3 pin19 through a separate current-limited, OVLO-protected, reverse-blocking branch.0.667A nominal\ncurrent setting;0.55A working load is unmeasured. Cold-start slew≈42.6V/s(≈77.5ms to3.3V). Press SW812 to disable/reset only\nthis port; fault probe TP812.\n\nSource / changes: Codex adaptation of TI TPS25947 SLVSFC9C(May2026), pin tablepp5–6, §7.3.2–7.3.5/pp26–32 and Fig8-1/p42;\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps25947.pdf . UsesTPS259470L active-limit/latch-off variant. RILM5k0.1%\nVishayPNM0805E5001BST5 (Vishay60057 Rev26-Jun-2026 pp2–3; https://www.vishay.com/docs/60057/pnm.pdf\n);UV15k/10k0.1%;OV19.1k/10k0.1% gives3.492Vnom/3.436–3.566Vstatic screen;47nF+100R DVDT;ITIMERopen(fastest). PG clamp diode,\nreset and1uF caps are Codex adaptations. Current0.566–0.768A is a conservativePVT screen, not a new guarantee. Molex467651001\nPS-46765-003 Rev9 sec4.2 rates0.8A/contact at25C: https://www.molex.com/en-us/products/part-detail/467651001 . Cable,\nother-end plug, transient and thermal qualification remain open."
    (at 998.32 2279.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "160f4b5f-8f46-5396-9bdd-580a96eb4b88"))
  (text
    "P4 / 3.3V PROTECTED POWER / INDIVIDUAL RESET"
